//ACCTNAMJ JOB ,NOTIFY=&SYSUID
//*-----------------------------------------------------------
//* VSAM EXERCISE 8 - INQUIRY BY HOLDER NAME THROUGH THE AIX
//* RUN ACCTAIX FIRST: IT DEFINES AND BUILDS THE AIX AND PATH.
//* READ-ONLY: THE JOB CAN BE RERUN AS MANY TIMES AS YOU LIKE.
//*-----------------------------------------------------------
//* STEP 1: COMPILE AND LINK ACCTNAME
//*-----------------------------------------------------------
//COMPLINK EXEC IGYWCL
//COBOL.SYSIN  DD DSN=Z79583.MY.COBOL(ACCTNAME),DISP=SHR
//LKED.SYSLMOD DD DSN=Z79583.MY.LOAD(ACCTNAME),DISP=SHR
//*-----------------------------------------------------------
//* STEP 2: RUN THE INQUIRY
//*   ACCTFILE = BASE CLUSTER
//*   ACCTFIL1 = PATH FOR THE FIRST ALTERNATE RECORD KEY
//*   TEST CASES IN INQIN (NAME IN COLUMNS 1-30):
//*     DIAZ MENDOZA, LUISA     3 ACCOUNTS (STATUS 02, 02, 00)
//*     RAMIREZ SILVA, ELENA    2 ACCOUNTS (STATUS 02, 00)
//*     BRICENO LUGO, CARMEN    1 ACCOUNT  (STATUS 00)
//*     SALAZAR PINTO, RAFAEL   1 ACCOUNT, BLOCKED
//*     LOPEZ GARCIA, PEDRO     NOT FOUND  (STATUS 23)
//*     (BLANK LINE)            INVALID
//*   EXPECTED: 6 INQUIRIES, 4 FOUND, 1 NOT FOUND, 1 BLANK,
//*             15 ACCOUNTS LISTED BY NAME, RC 4
//*-----------------------------------------------------------
//RUN      EXEC PGM=ACCTNAME,COND=(4,LT)
//STEPLIB  DD DSN=Z79583.MY.LOAD,DISP=SHR
//ACCTFILE DD DSN=Z79583.MY.ACCOUNTS.KSDS,DISP=SHR
//ACCTFIL1 DD DSN=Z79583.MY.ACCOUNTS.PATH,DISP=SHR
//SYSOUT   DD SYSOUT=*
//CEEDUMP  DD SYSOUT=*
//INQIN    DD *
DIAZ MENDOZA, LUISA
RAMIREZ SILVA, ELENA
BRICENO LUGO, CARMEN
SALAZAR PINTO, RAFAEL
LOPEZ GARCIA, PEDRO

/*
